        {
          "id": 536782301,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I mean brew bug, as in brew is incorrectly installing or sym-linking two incompatible packages to the same location here:\n\n`/usr/local/include/QtCore -> ../Cellar/qt/6.0.2/include/QtCore`\n\nThis is just broken. It needs to be handled by `pkg-config` or similar mechanisms instead.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2639362,
            "username": "jvalverde",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "João Valverde",
            "state": "active",
